0,47.0,49.0,38.0,33.0,30.0,41.0,44.0,43.0]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;line&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Speediance app&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#ffb340&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2,&quot;data&quot;:[null,null,null,56.0,null,null,null,32.0,null,null,22.0,null,null,null]}]}\"></div></figure></section>"},{"chart":"recovery-trends","title":"1. Recovery Trends (Multi-Source)","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This enhanced multi-source recovery graph overlays WHOOP Recovery (blue circles), Garmin Sleep Score (green triangles, distinct from Body Battery), 8Sleep Fitness Score (purple squares), and Speediance app Recovery (amber diamonds) with color-coded threshold zones: <span style=\"color: #32d74b;\">green (&gt;60 - good recovery)</span>, <span style=\"color: #ffd60a;\">yellow (30-60 - moderate)</span>, and <span style=\"color: #ff453a;\">red (&lt;30 - critical stress)</span>. Orange markers (▼) indicate unavailable Eight Sleep data. Gaps in the lines represent missing data rather than interpolated values, providing an accurate view of your recovery patterns across multiple tracking platforms.</p>"},{"chart":"strength-benchmark","title":"2. Strength Benchmark (Monday)","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This chart illustrates your typical strength output for this day of the week compared to other days over recent weeks. Observe any patterns or deviations from your usual volume to understand its role in your weekly training cycle and progression.</p>"},{"chart":"cardio-intensity","title":"3. Cardio Intensity (Distance vs Strain)","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This chart tracks running distance against WHOOP workout/activity strain (not whole-day strain), plus Garmin aerobic and anaerobic Training Effect on their native 0-5 scale.</p>"},{"chart":"weekly-load","title":"4. Weekly Load Progression","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This graph shows your total training load, combining lifting volume and running distance, aggregated week-over-week. It helps in assessing your long-term training progression and avoiding overtraining.</p>"},{"chart":"fueling","title":"5. Fueling vs Output","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This chart compares your daily caloric intake (consumed) with your estimated caloric expenditure (burned) over the past 14 days, offering insights into your energy balance for recovery and performance.</p>"},{"chart":"sleep-debt","title":"6. Composite Recovery Trend","caption":"<p class=\"insight-pill\">This existing composite uses 50% WHOOP Recovery, 30% Garmin Sleep Score and 20% Eight Sleep Score. It is a derived dashboard index, not a measured sleep-debt value. All three original sources are required for this composite. Speediance is shown separately in the native-score comparisons.</p>"},{"html":"<div class=\"footer\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;\"><p><a href=\"./historical_progress_report_2026-11-02.html\" style=\"color: #007AFF; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;\">🔗 Dashboard Link: Full Historical Progress</a></p></div>"}]}
